hes to total speculative attempts, not just individual token success rates.", "error": null, "reasoning_output": "", "final_output": "Speculative decoding generates multiple candidate tokens in parallel, unlike autoregressive generation which produces one token at a time. For three tokens, the model might propose T1, T2, T3 simultaneously. If any candidate fails validation (e.g., violates constraints), the entire speculative batch is rejected, forcing a restart. A 50% draft-token acceptance rate doesn't indicate speedup because it ignores batch-level rejection. Rejections nullify prior speculative work, so true speedup depends on the ratio of accepted batches to total speculative attempts, not just individual token success rates.", "reasoning_tokens": null, "final_tokens": null, "channel_token_count_source": null, "server_reasoning_tokens": null, "stream_events": [{"elapsed_ms": 25.36481898277998, "event": {"id": "chatcmpl-bb54e89217b166f9", "object": "chat.completion.chunk", "created": 1793362097, "model": "faruk_zahiragic/swiss-ai/Apertus-v1.5-8B-dspark-e10-k3", "choices": [{"index": 0, "delta": {"role": "assistant", "content": ""}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": null}], "prompt_token_ids": null, "prompt_text": null}}, {"elapsed_ms": 25.417554192245007, "event": {"id": "chatcmpl-bb54e89217b166f9", "object": "chat.completion.chunk", "created": 1793362097, "model": "faruk_zahiragic/swiss-ai/Apertus-v1.5-8B-dspark-e10-k3", "choices": [{"index": 0, "delta": {"content": "Spec"}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": null, "token_ids": null}]}}, {"elapsed_ms": 29.090268071740866, "event": {"id": "chatcmpl-bb54e89217b166f9", "object": "chat.completion.chunk", "created": 1793362097, "model": "faruk_zahiragic/swiss-ai/Apertus-v1.5-8B-dspark-e10-k3", "choices": [{"index": 0, "delta": {"content": "ulative decoding generates"}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": null, "token_ids": null}]}}, {"elapsed_ms": 36.62106720730662, "event": {"id": "chatcmpl-bb54e89217b166f9", "objec